36 0 obj
<<
/Dest [ 12 0 R /Fit ] /Next 37 0 R /Parent 35 0 R /Title (Experimental Design & Leakage Prevention- Training Partition: 80 training trips evaluated via 5-fold GroupKFold strictly partitioned by trip_id. This ensures zero data leakage between training and validation folds \(no observation from any trip appears in both\).- Student-Testing Partition: 10 unseen student-testing trips used exclusively for development-stage model selection.- Feature Standardization: Standard scaling applied within folds to avoid leakage for linear and neural network models.- Reproducibility: Random seed fixed to 42 across all data partitions and model initializations.)
>>
endobj
